ed beneath Mayfair and the City":"隐匿于梅费尔与金融城地下的烛光酒窖与私人餐室","Private evening Thames crossings paired with discreet riverside arrivals":"泰晤士河私人夜航与低调河畔抵岸体验","Late-night Soho jazz rooms, intimate listening bars and quiet tables away from the crowds":"苏豪区深夜爵士乐室、私密聆听吧与远离喧嚣的静谧餐席","Tell us what you are in the mood for — a long weekend away, an understated celebration or a Savile Row introduction — and our Mayfair desk will build tailored ideas around your dates.":"告诉我们您的心意——无论是悠长周末、低调庆典还是萨维尔街引荐——我们的梅费尔团队都会围绕您的日期量身构思方案。","Direct Mayfair Desk":"梅费尔直属礼宾部","The Global Luxury Consortium":"全球奢华礼宾联盟 (TGLC)","Prefer a real conversation to filling in a form? Speak directly with our team on Albemarle Street — every enquiry is answered personally, in complete confidence.":"更偏爱直接交谈而非填写表单？欢迎致电我们位于阿尔伯马尔街的团队——每一项垂询皆由专人亲自、保密回复。","From early morning private arrivals to late dinners in Mayfair, one trusted voice keeps every moving part calm and connected.":"从清晨私人抵港到梅费尔深夜晚宴，一位值得信赖的专属联络人让每个环节从容衔接。","Seven connected practice areas under one dedicated Mayfair desk — so your flights, dining rooms, residences, chauffeurs and rare commissions all move in step.":"七大互联专业领域汇聚于梅费尔专属办公室——让您的航班、餐厅、府邸、司乘与珍稀委托始终步调一致。","We warmly cater to Islamic and Muslim traditions — from certified halal fine dining, Ramadan Iftar and Suhoor hospitality, alcohol-free suites and prayer-space preparation to private family residences and female chauffeurs on request.":"我们热忱周到地服务伊斯兰与穆斯林传统——从认证清真精致餐饮、斋月开斋饭与封斋饭礼遇、无酒精套房与祈祷空间布置，到私密家庭宅邸及按需安排女性专职司机。","We respect every culture, faith and family custom equally — welcoming Jewish, Hindu, Jain, Sikh, East Asian and European households across twenty global languages.":"我们平等尊重每一种文化、信仰与家族习俗——以二十种全球语言热情迎接犹太教、印度教、耆那教、锡克教、东亚及欧洲家庭。","Islamic & Halal":"伊斯兰与清真","Ramadan, Halal Dining & Family Privacy":"斋月礼遇、清真餐饮与家庭隐私","All Cultures":"多元文化","Global Faiths & Family Customs":"世界信仰与家族礼俗","Islamic, Muslim & global traditions, quietly honoured.":"伊斯兰、穆斯林与全球多元传统，皆以静谧之心敬呈。","Thoughtful London stays sha